<!-- =====================================================================
     WHO WE ARE — About and bilateral benefit panels
     ===================================================================== -->
<section class="about-section section-space" id="why" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <span class="slab restored-slab" data-scrub="enter" aria-hidden="true"></span>

  <div class="page-shell">
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Who we are</p>
        <h2 id="about-title">The bridge between<br>Ghana and Europe.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="about-copy">
        <p>AI Hub, Ghana is a not-for-profit initiative connecting Ghana's growing artificial intelligence ecosystem with Europe. Ghana brings strong AI talent, entrepreneurial energy and government backing through its National AI Strategy. The Hub creates a structured route to European markets.</p>
        <p>We help European organisations access Ghanaian talent and solutions, while connecting Ghanaian companies and professionals with European clients, projects and partnerships.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bilateral-grid" id="opportunity">
      <article class="benefit-panel european-benefits" id="corridor">
        <p class="panel-kicker">Europe – Ghana</p>
        <h3>For European organisations</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Vetted Ghanaian AI professionals and teams</li>
          <li>Cost-effective delivery capacity for practical AI work</li>
          <li>Transparent governance and EU AI Act readiness support</li>
          <li>An on-the-ground presence in Accra</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="benefit-panel ghanaian-benefits" id="membership">
        <p class="panel-kicker">Ghana – Europe</p>
        <h3>For Ghanaian talent and ventures</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>European clients and project work</li>
          <li>Training and certification to international standards</li>
          <li>Incubation support for AI-enabled ventures</li>
          <li>Placement on international assignments</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="mission-note">
      <span class="mission-shape" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <p>We support young Ghanaian companies with AI tools, training and incubation to help bring their ideas to market. All surpluses are reinvested in AI skills, jobs and businesses.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- The four-colour corridor bar, reading Accra to Europe -->
  <div class="corridor restored-corridor" data-scrub="enter" aria-hidden="true">
    <i style="width:26%;background:#bf4639"></i>
    <i style="width:22%;background:#eac15d"></i>
    <i style="width:24%;background:#74c2ac"></i>
    <i style="width:28%;background:#2a7a5e"></i>
  </div>
</section>
